      "label": "<FONT COLOR=\"#FFFFFF\"><B>Requirement</B><BR/><B>Strict JSJSON Card Encoding</B><BR/><BR/>Aurora card files SHALL be stored as strict JSON (RFC 8259) using the .jsjson ex<BR/>tension: double quotes, no comments, no trailing commas, UTF-8 encoding, and exa<BR/>ctly one trailing newline.<BR/></FONT>",
