    {
      "_gvid": 14,
      "name": "REQ_017",
      "label": "<FONT COLOR=\"#FFFFFF\"><B>Requirement</B><BR/><B>Identifiers, Filenames, and Model Layout</B><BR/><BR/>Aurora cards SHALL use stable identifiers (e.g., MIS-001) that MUST NOT change o<BR/>nce issued. Card files SHALL be named &lt;id&gt;-&lt;Sanitized_Name&gt;.jsjson, where specia<BR/>l characters are stripped and spaces are replaced with underscores. Models SHALL<BR/> follow the Model Home and Mission folder layout conventions so tools can discov<BR/>er, validate, and render deterministically.<BR/></FONT>",
