    {
      "_gvid": 16,
      "name": "REQ_025",
      "label": "<FONT COLOR=\"#FFFFFF\"><B>Requirement</B><BR/><B>Model Integrity Validation</B><BR/><BR/>Aurora models SHALL be machine-validatable for integrity: every non-Mission, non<BR/>-Note card SHALL have at least one incoming link; every card SHALL be reachable <BR/>from the Mission; and all links[].target values SHALL reference an existing card<BR/> id.<BR/></FONT>",
