    {
      "_gvid": 17,
      "name": "REQ_028",
      "label": "<FONT COLOR=\"#FFFFFF\"><B>Requirement</B><BR/><B>Semantics Derived from Invariants</B><BR/><BR/>Aurora card and relationship labels SHALL be treated as descriptive metadata; th<BR/>e meaning of the architecture SHALL be derived from the model’s invariant rules <BR/>and the current view’s inclusion/projection of card types and links.<BR/></FONT>",
